    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41494" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιφαύσκω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-φαύσω</span> (v. infr.):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shine out,</i> of the sun or
			moon, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jb.</u>
				25.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				31.26
			</span></i> : also in pass. form, ib.<i><span class="en">
				41.9(10)
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιφαύσει σοι ὁ Χριστός</span>
			<i>will shine out</i> for thee,<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Eph.</u>
				5.14
			</span></i>.</div>
